# Active Directory Home Lab — Architecture and Setup

## 1. Project Overview

This project simulates a small business IT environment using Windows Server 2022, Windows 11, and Oracle VirtualBox.

The purpose of the lab is to gain hands-on experience with Active Directory administration, DNS configuration, domain management, Group Policy, and Help Desk support operations.

## 2. Lab Environment

| Component | Configuration |
|---|---|
| Virtualization Platform | Oracle VirtualBox |
| Domain Controller | Windows Server 2022 |
| Client Workstation | Windows 11 |
| Domain Name | ad.sterlingtech.test |
| NetBIOS Domain | STERLINGTECH |
| Domain Controller | DC01 |
| Client Computer | CLIENT01 |
| Virtual Network | Internal Network: AD-LAB |

## 3. Network Configuration

| Device | IP Address | Subnet Mask |
|---|---|---|
| DC01 | 192.168.10.10 | 255.255.255.0 |
| CLIENT01 | 192.168.10.20 | 255.255.255.0 |

**DNS Configuration:** CLIENT01 uses DC01 (192.168.10.10) as its preferred DNS server.

**Network Design:** Both virtual machines use the same VirtualBox Internal Network named AD-LAB to communicate in an isolated lab environment.

## 4. Active Directory Configuration

Configured Active Directory Domain Services (AD DS) and promoted DC01 to a domain controller for a new forest.

Created the domain:

- ad.sterlingtech.test
- NetBIOS name: STERLINGTECH

Configured DNS to support domain name resolution and Active Directory services.

## 5. Organizational Units

Created the following organizational units to organize domain accounts:

- IT
- Human Resources
- Finance
- Operations

## 6. Project Objectives

- Deploy and configure a Windows Server domain controller.
- Configure DNS and network connectivity.
- Join a Windows 11 workstation to the domain.
- Create and manage domain users and security groups.
- Configure and test Group Policy Objects.
- Perform Help Desk account management and troubleshooting.
- Practice employee account offboarding.

## 7. Tools and Technologies

- Windows Server 2022
- Windows 11
- Active Directory Domain Services
- DNS
- Group Policy Management
- Active Directory Users and Computers
- Windows PowerShell
- Event Viewer
